DESCRIPTION:Live It (Eshha) is one of Riyadh’s largest sports entertainment and family fan zones during the FIFA World Cup 2026. Designed to capture the excitement of the tournament\, the venue features giant match screens\, live entertainment\, gaming zones\, and interactive experiences for football fans of all ages. Book Now
